# The files under .github/ are generated and maintained by the ioBroker bot templates.
# They use their own style (2-space indentation, double quotes) which does not match the
# @iobroker/eslint-config Prettier configuration. Ignoring them stops Prettier from
# rewriting them on save, which otherwise produced formatting-only merge noise on every
# template update.
#
# Remove the matching entries once the ioBroker templates follow the ESLint config style.
.github/**/*.yml
.github/**/*.yaml
.github/**/*.md
